# Shepherd of the Clouds: "Return that card to the battlefield instead if you control a Mount." Bot1 controls Bulwark Ox (a Mount) when the
# Shepherd enters, so the Ornithopter (an artifact creature, mana value 0) in its graveyard comes back to the battlefield and not to the hand;
# the Ornithopter is the only card in the graveyard, so it is chosen without a question.

